-- **The leak — `~2kc72`.** A rule HEAD is a pattern: it needs the tag and the
-- production key, and neither is a declared name, so the withheld language is
-- still matchable. `./tc test/modules/TakesLang.thena.rules` loads.
rule base takes where

import test.modules.WithheldLang

rule describe LC[app]`( ${f} ${a} )` :- do
  say "an application"
